-- 5. Canteen — Break. Cups, trays, cutlery, a bottle hoot; the crate stays
-- under the table. The sax gets the tune.
-- ~36 cycles (~86 s at 100 BPM).

glideBpm 100 16
-- the sweeper parks; the room fills with small objects
fadeSilence 12 [1,2,8,9]
d1 brush
xfadeIn 2 16 $ stack [cupTick, canteenBell]
xfadeIn 3 16 $ stack [cupClink, bottleHoot]
xfadeIn 4 16 compCant
xfadeIn 5 24 colourCant
xfadeIn 6 16 bassCant

-- trays, cutlery and a drink being poured
xfadeIn 9 16 $ stack [tray, cutlery, pour]
xfadeIn 10 24 $ stack [air, yardAir]

-- the reed gets the tune
xfadeIn 7 24 reedCant
